#. そもそも、大和田クンが持ってる電子生徒手帳って、
#. 本当に<CLT 3>大和田クンの物<CLT>なの…？
msgctxt "0001 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"Mondo, the handbook you have right now... Is it really\n"
"<CLT 3>yours<CLT>?"
msgstr ""

#. …ど、どういう意味だッ！？
msgctxt "0002 | MONDO OOWADA"
msgid "...The fuck is that supposed to mean!?"
msgstr ""

#. 玄関ホールにあった<CLT 3>壊れた電子生徒手帳<CLT>…
msgctxt "0003 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "The <CLT 3>broken handbook<CLT> that was in the main hall..."
msgstr ""

#. 本当は、あの手帳が
#. 大和田クンの物なんじゃないの…？
msgctxt "0004 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Isn't that one actually yours?"
msgstr ""

#. き、君は…さっきから何を言ってるんだ…！
msgctxt "0005 | KIYOTAKA ISHIMARU"
msgid "What the heck are you talking about!?"
msgstr ""

#. つまり、大和田クンは
#. <CLT 3>交換<CLT>したんじゃないのかな？
msgctxt "0006 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"What I mean is, I think Mondo <CLT 3>swapped<CLT> his handbook\n"
"out for one that actually works."
msgstr ""

#. 壊れた自分の電子生徒手帳と、
#. 桑田クンの電子生徒手帳を…
msgctxt "0007 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"I think he took Leon's handbook and replaced it with\n"
"his own..."
msgstr ""

#. だって、モノクマも言ってたはずだよ？
#. 桑田クンの手帳が壊れたはずないって。
msgctxt "0008 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"After all, Monokuma said himself that Leon's handbook\n"
"never should have broken."
msgstr ""

#. そうですね！　あの程度のおしおきでは壊れませんよ！
msgctxt "0009 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"That's right! The punishment it suffered wasn't nearly\n"
"enough to destroy it!"
msgstr ""

#. つまり、玄関ホールに置かれていたのは、
#. 実は<CLT 3>“大和田君の電子生徒手帳”<CLT>で…
msgctxt "0010 | CELES"
msgid ""
"So then, the broken handbook in the main hall is\n"
"actually <CLT 3>Mondo's<CLT>."
msgstr ""

#. そして今、大和田君が持っている物こそが、
#. <CLT 3>“桑田君の電子生徒手帳”<CLT>という事ですね？
msgctxt "0011 | CELES"
msgid ""
"Which would mean that the handbook Mondo has right now\n"
"is actually <CLT 3>Leon's<CLT>, yes?"
msgstr ""

#. でも、交換って校則に引っ掛からないの？
#. <CLT 3>他人に貸すのは禁止<CLT>っていう…
msgctxt "0012 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"But doesn't that violate the school regulation that\n"
"says <CLT 3>loaning out your handbook<CLT> is prohibited?"
msgstr ""

#. ボクはこう判断しました…
msgctxt "0013 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "Well, here's how I look at it..."
msgstr ""

#. 『他人への貸与禁止』という校則ではありますが、
#. 死人は他人なのか…いや、もはや人ではないので…
msgctxt "0014 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"There is a rule about loaning your handbook to another\n"
"student. But if they're dead, they're not a student!"
msgstr ""

#. グレーゾーンですがオッケーです！
#. 何より面白いのでオッケーにしました！！
msgctxt "0015 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"It's kind of a grey area, I admit, but no worries! If\n"
"anything, it just makes things more interesting!"
msgstr ""

#. よって、死人と電子生徒手帳を交換しても、
#. ルール違反にはならないと判断しました！
msgctxt "0016 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"As such, I decree that exchanging handbooks with a\n"
"corpse is not a violation of the rules!"
msgstr ""

#. どうなの、大和田クン…？
#. 今の推理が間違ってるなら言ってくれないか？
msgctxt "0017 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"Well, Mondo? If I'm wrong about this, you're welcome\n"
"to say so."
msgstr ""

#. 間違ってるなら…ボクはそれでいいんだけど…
msgctxt "0018 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "I'm happy to admit I made a mistake, but..."
msgstr ""

#. オ、オメェ…！
msgctxt "0019 | MONDO OOWADA"
msgid "S-Son of a bitch...!"
msgstr ""

#. ど、どうしたんだ兄弟？
#. 言ってやりたまえ…間違いだと…
msgctxt "0020 | KIYOTAKA ISHIMARU"
msgid "What's wrong, bro? Come on, tell him he's wrong...!"
msgstr ""

#. そうだ…間違いだ…
#. 間違いに決まっている…！
msgctxt "0021 | KIYOTAKA ISHIMARU"
msgid "You ARE wrong! You HAVE to be wrong...!"
msgstr ""

#. 今の推理は、どこかが決定的に間違っている！！
#. すべて、お前のでっち上げなんだッ！！
msgctxt "0022 | KIYOTAKA ISHIMARU"
msgid "Everything you just said is wrong! You made it all up!"
msgstr ""

#. …だったら、もう１度、
#. 最初から事件を振り返ってみようか？
msgctxt "0023 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"Okay, then why don't we look back on this case one\n"
"more time, from the beginning?"
msgstr ""

#. 今の推理が正しいかどうか…
#. すべては、そこで判明するはずだよ…！
msgctxt "0024 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"That way, everything will become clear, and we'll all\n"
"see if I was right or wrong!"
msgstr ""
